  dialogueLines:
  - Hi! Welcome to this  activity!
  - This activity needs 3 people to complete!
  - You can click station A, B and C for a clue. Your clue only shows up on your
    screen. And each person gets only 1 clue.
  - Its hard to complete this activity alone. So, you can share your clue with your
    teammates and discuss among yourselves.
  - After discussing, choose an answer together on the screen and press Submit answer.
  - If it's wrong,don't worry I will give you a hint!
  - Have fun!
